		  Baseline        Patched
  shared (16k)    1571857         1641435         + 4.4%
  autosize (512)   646390          903371         +39.7%
  -b 256           464395          587014         +26.4%
  -b 512           715687          995943         +39.2%
  -b 1024          995085         1396328         +40.3%
  -b 2048         1293114         1668395         +29.0%
  -b 4096         2124438         2240228         + 5.5%

