                  Baseline        Patched
  shared  (16k)   1275840         1381279         + 8.2%
  autosize (512)  1252745         1482179         +18.3%
  -b 256           856274          955455         +11.5%
  -b 512          1267490         1544010         +21.8%
  -b 1024         1424013         1625424         +14.1%
  -b 2048         1505181         1669342         +10.9%
  -b 4096         1465993         1688932         +15.2%

